law-iv-duke-of-pomerania"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/bogislaw-iv-duke-of-pomerania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Bogislaw IV, Duke of Pomerania</span><span class="cty-y">c. 1258–1309</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:28.7%;width:9.3%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/elizabeth-of-pomerania"><span class="pp-av"></span><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Elizabeth of Pomerania</span><span class="cty-y">c. 1347–1393</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:44.9%;width:8.4%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/eric-of-pomerania"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/eric-of-pomerania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Eric of Pomerania</span><span class="cty-y">c. 1382–1459</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:51.3%;width:14.0%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/wartislaw-ix-duke-of-pomerania"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/wartislaw-ix-duke-of-pomerania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Wartislaw IX, Duke of Pomerania</span><span class="cty-y">c. 1400–1457</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:54.5%;width:10.4%"></span></span></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/eric-ii-duke-of-pomerania"><img class="pp-av" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/eric-ii-duke-of-pomerania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28"><span class="pp-nm"><span class="cty-n">Eric II, Duke of Pomerania</span><span class="cty-y">c. 1425–1474</span></span></a><span class="cty-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cty-bar pp-life" style="left:59.1%;width:8.9%"></span></span></li><